{"seq":2,"slug":"marxist-political-economy","title":"马克思主义政治经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"marxism","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 马克思主义政治经济学 简介\n\n马克思主义政治经济学是马克思对资本主义生产方式进行深刻剖析的理论结晶。与古典政治经济学不同，马克思不满足于描述经济现象的表面规律，而是深入到商品、货币和资本的内在本质，揭示了资本主义财富积累背后的社会关系和阶级关系。这一理论体系不仅是理解十九世纪资本主义的钥匙，也为分析当代全球经济提供了穿透性的分析框架。\n\n本知识库面向希望深入理解经济运行本质的读者，特别是那些不满足于主流经济学对市场机制的技术性描述，而想从社会关系和权力结构的角度理解经济现象的学习者。你不需要具备经济学专业背景，但对\"利润从何而来\"\"工资由什么决定\"\"经济危机为何反复发生\"这类根本性问题抱有探究兴趣。\n\n全书共分四个章节，从微观的商品分析逐步扩展到宏观的当代经济：\n\n第一章**商品与价值理论**从资本主义经济的最基本单元——商品出发。你将理解商品的使用价值与交换价值的二重性、劳动价值论的核心命题、货币如何从商品交换中自然产生，以及价值形式从简单到复杂的演变过程，掌握理解整个政治经济学的理论起点。\n\n第二章**剩余价值理论**揭示资本主义利润的真正来源。从剩余价值的生产过程到绝对剩余价值与相对剩余价值的区别，从剥削率的计算到工资与劳动力商品的本质关系，这一章将帮助你理解资本与劳动之间最根本的经济关系。\n\n第三章**资本积累与再生产**分析资本主义经济的动态运行规律。从简单再生产到扩大再生产的逻辑演进，资本有机构成的变化趋势，资本积累的一般规律及其社会后果，以及原始积累的历史过程，帮助你理解资本主义从兴起到扩张的内在机制。\n\n第四章**当代政治经济学**将马克思的分析框架延伸到当代经济现实。从垄断资本主义的形成到金融化浪潮的深层逻辑，从全球价值链的权力格局到数字经济的马克思主义分析，这一章展示了经典理论在解释当代经济现象时依然具有的解释力和批判力。\n\n建议从第一章开始顺序学习，商品与价值理论是整个政治经济学的逻辑起点，后续章节的分析都建立在这一基础之上。第二章是全书的核心和难点，需要反复研读。第三章和第四章可以在掌握基础理论后根据兴趣选择重点突破。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"commodity-value","title":"商品与价值理论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/commodity-value","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"commodity-analysis","title":"商品分析：使用价值与交换价值","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/commodity-value/commodity-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"labor-theory-value","title":"劳动价值论","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/commodity-value/labor-theory-value"},{"seq":3,"slug":"money-origin","title":"货币起源与本质","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/commodity-value/money-origin"},{"seq":4,"slug":"value-form","title":"价值形式分析","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/commodity-value/value-form"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"surplus-value","title":"剩余价值理论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/surplus-value","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"surplus-value-production","title":"剩余价值生产","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/surplus-value/surplus-value-production"},{"seq":2,"slug":"absolute-relative-surplus","title":"绝对剩余价值与相对剩余价值","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/surplus-value/absolute-relative-surplus"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rate-of-exploitation","title":"剥削率与利润率","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/surplus-value/rate-of-exploitation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"wage-labor-capital","title":"工资、劳动与资本","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/surplus-value/wage-labor-capital"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"capital-accumulation","title":"资本积累与再生产","docCount":4,"url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/capital-accumulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"simple-expanded-reproduction","title":"简单再生产与扩大再生产","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/capital-accumulation/simple-expanded-reproduction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"capital-organic-composition","title":"资本有机构成","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/capital-accumulation/capital-organic-composition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"general-law-accumulation","title":"资本积累一般规律","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/capital-accumulation/general-law-accumulation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"primitive-accumulation","title":"原始积累","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/capital-accumulation/primitive-accumulation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"contemporary-political-economy","title":"当代政治经济学","docCount":4,"url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/contemporary-political-economy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monopoly-capitalism","title":"垄断资本主义","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/contemporary-political-economy/monopoly-capitalism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"financialization","title":"金融化","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/contemporary-political-economy/financialization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-value-chains","title":"全球价值链","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/contemporary-political-economy/global-value-chains"},{"seq":4,"slug":"digital-economy-marxism","title":"数字经济的马克思主义分析","url":"/h/marxism/marxist-political-economy/contemporary-political-economy/digital-economy-marxism"}]}]}